== Project conclusions <sec:project-conclusions>
This document has described the design, and implementation of interrupts,
timers, and MMIO in the CREATOR simulator.

This project presents a simple, open-source, and intuitive simulator, focused on
providing the user an intuitive knowledge of \gls{ISA} design and \gls{assembly}
programming.

